  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the fries between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64b5fb124c7af7ea302e0ac1-2151d87e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate beetroot.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook beetroot, the balsamic vinegar and the brown sugar until softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add the water and cook, stirring occasionally, until reduced, 5-6 minutes. Season to taste. Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64b5fb124c7af7ea302e0ac1-bb0d9fc8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the fries have 10 minutes remaining, wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Slice haloumi horizontally to get 1 piece per person.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64b5fb124c7af7ea302e0ac1-174db9a7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, halve plant-based burger buns and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64b5fb124c7af7ea302e0ac1-47991b23.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice tomato.\n• Spread buns bases with Dijon mustard and half the plant-based aioli.\n• Top with a haloumi slice, beetroot relish, tomato and spinach & rocket mix.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64b5fb124c7af7ea302e0ac1-19b347ab.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide haloumi burgers and herby fries between plates.\n• Serve with remaining aioli and beetroot relish. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64b5fb124c7af7ea302e0ac1-c78dba24.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
